            %p
              But in
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spectra"} Spectra
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+cofiber+sequences"} homotopy cofiber sequences
              are
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+fiber+sequences"} homotopy fiber sequences
              (by
              = succeed ")," do
                %a{:href => "Spectrum#InSpectraHomotopyFiberSequencesAreHomotopyCofiberSequences"} this Prop.
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universal+property"} universal property
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+fibers"} homotopy fibers
              the class of the above diagram is equivalently the class of a map from
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
